title Verbalization Flow

participant "User/CLI" as User
participant "DiscoveryPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "VerbalizationEngine" as Engine
participant "VerbalizationStrategy" as Strategy
participant "PatternMatcher" as Matcher
participant "HashManager" as HashMgr
participant "VerbalizationStore" as Store
participant "ContextProvider" as Context
participant "LLM Client" as LLM
participant "FeedbackCollector" as Feedback

note over User, Feedback: === Phase 1: Initialization ===

User->Pipeline: Execute discovery with verbalization
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Engine: verbalize(clusterId, symbols, strategy, intent)
activate Engine

Engine->Store: getHashes(clusterId)
activate Store
Store-->Engine: Existing hashes
deactivate Store

Engine->HashMgr: loadHashes(hashes)
activate HashMgr
HashMgr-->Engine: Hashes loaded
deactivate HashMgr

note over User, Feedback: === Phase 2: Strategy Selection ===

alt Incremental Strategy
    Engine->Strategy: IncrementalVerbalizationStrategy
    activate Strategy
    note right of Strategy: Fast, hash-based\nchange detection
    deactivate Strategy
else Multi-Pass Strategy
    Engine->Strategy: MultiPassVerbalizationStrategy
    activate Strategy
    note right of Strategy: Context-aware\nrefinement
    deactivate Strategy
else Learning Strategy
    Engine->Strategy: LearningVerbalizationStrategy
    activate Strategy
    note right of Strategy: LLM-powered\nwith feedback
    deactivate Strategy
end

note over User, Feedback: === Phase 3: Symbol Processing ===

loop For each symbol in cluster
    Engine->Strategy: verbalize(symbols, intent)
    activate Strategy
    
    alt Incremental Strategy Flow
        Strategy->HashMgr: computeHash(symbol)
        activate HashMgr
        HashMgr-->Strategy: currentHash
        deactivate HashMgr
        
        Strategy->HashMgr: hasChanged(symbol, currentHash)
        activate HashMgr
        HashMgr-->Strategy: true/false
        deactivate HashMgr
        
        alt Symbol Changed
            Strategy->Matcher: matchAndDescribe(symbol)
            activate Matcher
            Matcher->Matcher: Apply regex patterns
            Matcher->Matcher: Extract code features
            Matcher-->Strategy: description + confidence
            deactivate Matcher
            
            Strategy->Strategy: Build VerbalizationResult
            Strategy->HashMgr: updateHash(symbol, currentHash)
            activate HashMgr
            HashMgr-->Strategy: Hash updated
            deactivate HashMgr
        else Symbol Unchanged
            Strategy->Strategy: Skip (use cached)
            note right of Strategy: Performance optimization
        end
    else Multi-Pass Strategy Flow
        note right of Strategy: === Pass 1: Basic Matching ===
        Strategy->Matcher: matchAndDescribe(symbol)
        activate Matcher
        Matcher-->Strategy: baseDescription
        deactivate Matcher
        
        note right of Strategy: === Pass 2: Context Refinement ===
        Strategy->Context: getContext(symbol)
        activate Context
        Context->Context: Find related symbols
        Context->Context: Analyze dependencies
        Context->Context: Detect DB access
        Context->Context: Detect external calls
        Context-->Strategy: SymbolContext
        deactivate Context
        
        Strategy->Strategy: refineWithContext(description, context)
        Strategy->Strategy: Add relationship info
        Strategy->Strategy: Add capability markers
        Strategy->Strategy: Build enhanced description
    else Learning Strategy Flow
        Strategy->Feedback: getFeedback(symbol)
        activate Feedback
        Feedback-->Strategy: Feedback or null
        deactivate Feedback
        
        alt User Feedback Exists
            Strategy->Strategy: Use accepted correction
            note right of Strategy: Highest confidence (0.95)
        else No Feedback
            Strategy->Matcher: matchAndDescribe(symbol)
            activate Matcher
            Matcher-->Strategy: patternHint
            deactivate Matcher
            
            Strategy->LLM: generateDescription(symbol, patternHint)
            activate LLM
            LLM->LLM: Analyze symbol signature
            LLM->LLM: Apply pattern hint
            LLM->LLM: Generate natural language
            LLM-->Strategy: LLM description
            deactivate LLM
            
            Strategy->Strategy: Build result with LLM output
        end
    end
    
    Strategy-->Engine: VerbalizationResult
    deactivate Strategy
end

note over User, Feedback: === Phase 4: Storage ===

Engine->Store: putVerbalizations(clusterId, results)
activate Store
Store->Store: Write verbalizations.yaml
Store-->Engine: Success
deactivate Store

Engine->HashMgr: getAllHashes()
activate HashMgr
HashMgr-->Engine: Updated hashes
deactivate HashMgr

Engine->Store: putHashes(clusterId, hashes)
activate Store
Store->Store: Update .meta/hashes.yaml
Store-->Engine: Success
deactivate Store

note over User, Feedback: === Phase 5: Return Results ===

Engine-->Pipeline: List<VerbalizationResult>
deactivate Engine

Pipeline->Pipeline: Store in semantic cache
Pipeline->Pipeline: Link to symbols

Pipeline-->User: Discovery complete with verbalizations
deactivate Pipeline

note over User, Feedback: === Example Results ===

note right of User: Incremental:\n"authenticate: Asynchronously executes\nauthentication operation"\nConfidence: 0.8

note right of User: Multi-Pass:\n"authenticate: Asynchronously executes\nauthentication operation (coordinates\nwith 3 related services)\nConfidence: 0.95

note right of User: Learning:\n"authenticate: Validates user credentials\nagainst identity provider and returns\nJWT token for session management"\nConfidence: 0.9

note over User, Feedback: === Custom Pattern Loading ===

User->Engine: loadCustomPatterns(config.yaml)
activate Engine

Engine->Engine: Read YAML file
Engine->Matcher: loadCustomPatterns(config.patterns)
activate Matcher

loop For each pattern in config
    Matcher->Matcher: Validate regex
    Matcher->Matcher: Parse description template
    Matcher->Matcher: Set confidence level
    Matcher->Matcher: Register pattern
end

Matcher-->Engine: Patterns loaded
deactivate Matcher

Engine-->User: Success
deactivate Engine

note right of User: Config example:\npatterns:\n  - code_pattern: "class (\\w+)Agent"\n    description: "AI Agent for $1 operations"\n    confidence: 0.9
